# =============================================================================
# Bright OS Home Edition — Additional applications
# Phase 6.3: lightweight core (labwc + greetd) plus user-facing apps.
# Heavy components like Bluetooth, Printing, and Android are included here
# because Home is the "kitchen-sink" edition for everyday users.
# Dev tools and Wine are NOT included (install post-install via flatpak/apt).
# =============================================================================

# --- Web / email / media ---
firefox-esr
thunderbird
vlc

# --- Graphics / office ---
gimp
inkscape
libreoffice-writer
libreoffice-calc
libreoffice-impress
libreoffice-draw
libreoffice-gtk3
libreoffice-math
evince
eog

# --- Utilities ---
simple-scan
cheese
gnome-calculator
gnome-screenshot
mtpaint

# --- Bluetooth and printing ---
bluez
blueman
cups
cups-filters
cups-bsd
system-config-printer

# --- VPN / mDNS for convenience on home networks ---
network-manager-openvpn
avahi-daemon
avahi-utils
